# Codebase Memory MCP

Server: **`user-codebase-memory-mcp`**. Strengths: symbols, callers/callees, routes, cross-service HTTP, precise file+line.

Routing (when to use Memory vs Graphify vs Grep) lives in `.cursor/rules/codebase-exploration.mdc` — follow that first.

## Project id

- Indexed name: **`D-repos-calorieTracker`**
- Always pass `project: "D-repos-calorieTracker"`.
- On `project not found`, use `available_projects` from the error (do not invent names).

## Tool map

| Goal | Tool | Notes |
|---|---|-----|
| Find defs / implementations | `search_graph` | `query` NL; `name_pattern` / `qn_pattern` regex; page with `offset` when `has_more` |
| Text text (enriched) | `search_code` | Graph-ranked; use before raw Grep |
| Callers / callees / impact | `trace_path` | `mode`: `calls`, `data_flow`, or `cross_service` |
| Read a known symbol | `get_code_snippet` | Needs `qualified_name` from `search_graph` |
| Packages / services / routes | `get_architecture` | Scope with `path` when useful |
| Multi-hop / aggregations | `query_graph` | Cypher; add `LIMIT` |
| Schema | `get_graph_schema` | Before complex Cypher |
| Refresh index | `index_repository` | `repo_path`: workspace root; prefer `mode: "fast"`; `moderate`/`full` for `semantic_query` |

## Rules of use

- Reuse `qualified_name` from results; do not guess paths from other projects.
- After large refactors or wrong-looking hits, re-index then search again.
- `persistence: true` only when asked (shared `.codebase-memory/graph.db.zst`).
- Never put secrets into Cypher or search queries beyond what already lives in the repo.
